// Custom UI layout, per version ("v1", "v2"...). A "default" entry applies to every version
// that has no entry of its own. Delete a version's entry (or this whole file) to go back to rows.
//
// "picto": the icon positions. Keys are the picto numbers (0 = first sound in app.json).
//   x, y, size: relative to the WIDTH of the icon area, so a row step is size + gap.
//               Numbers are read as %, "px" values work too ("12px").
//   z:          optional stacking order (z-index)
//   Icons with no entry are placed on extra rows below the others.
//
// You can also define the same thing in JS as `_UI = { "v1": { "picto": {...} } }`
// (it is merged over this file).
{
